+/*
+ * read_random, never random_buf (2323b). random_buf needs the corecrypto kext's g_crypto_funcs, which SWEET never
+ * registers, so it always failed here: every id came out all zero, the store refused it four times and every
+ * ACMContextCreate answered -4 (ast247). read_random is the kernel PRNG itself and cannot fail; a DRBG error panics.
+ * The store still refuses an all-zero or repeated id.
+ */
